    "operationId": "intercom.conversations",
    "summary": "2 variants: reply, note",
    "description": "[intercom.conversations.reply] Post a response to an Intercom conversation. Send a message back within an existing thread.\n\n[intercom.conversations.note] Insert an internal note into an Intercom conversation. Compose a private agent annotation. Set message_type to 'note' to differentiate from public replies.",
